IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `tsofa-financing`

-- Terrorism (Suppression of Financing) Act 2002, ss 2 to 10B, 14, 34 and 35 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_terrorism-suppression-of-financing-act-2002.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

