§ `ss 4 and 7`

`a donation to fund a bombing` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`a loan to a listed individual` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS FALSE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`an exempted payment to a listed individual` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS FALSE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS TRUE

`an exempted payment with conditions unmet` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS FALSE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`an exempted payment to a terrorist entity` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS FALSE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS TRUE

`an exempted payment that funds an attack` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS TRUE

`an innocent sale to a stranger` MEANS Supply WITH
    `collects, provides, invites or makes available property or services` IS TRUE
    `intends or has grounds to believe it will facilitate a terrorist act` IS FALSE
    `has grounds to believe it will be used by or benefit a terrorist or terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `will benefit a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

