§ `ss 6 and 7`

`a Singapore bank paying out a listed person's deposit` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS FALSE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS TRUE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`a citizen abroad selling a terrorist's car` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS TRUE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS TRUE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`a foreigner abroad selling a terrorist's car` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS FALSE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS TRUE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`a bank with no reason to suspect the owner` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS FALSE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS FALSE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS FALSE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

`an exempted bank paying a terrorist entity's account` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS FALSE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS TRUE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS TRUE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS TRUE

`a bank relying on an exemption whose conditions are unmet` MEANS Dealing WITH
    `the dealer is in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the dealer is a Singapore citizen` IS FALSE
    `deals, transacts or provides services in the property` IS TRUE
    `has grounds to believe the property is a terrorist's` IS TRUE
    `the property belongs to a terrorist entity` IS FALSE
    `falls within a Minister's exemption order` IS TRUE
    `meets the exemption's conditions` IS FALSE

