§ `s 10B`

`a bank clerk warning a customer of a police probe` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS TRUE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS FALSE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS FALSE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS FALSE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS FALSE

`a solicitor advising a client about the probe` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS TRUE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS FALSE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS FALSE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS FALSE

`a solicitor helping a client hide the funds` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS TRUE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS TRUE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS TRUE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS FALSE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS FALSE

`a clerk who could not have suspected prejudice` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS TRUE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS FALSE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS FALSE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS TRUE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS FALSE

`an officer telling a foreign agency` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS TRUE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS FALSE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS FALSE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS FALSE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS TRUE

`a harmless remark` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `knows or suspects an investigation or a report` IS TRUE
    `is likely to prejudice the investigation` IS FALSE
    `is by a lawyer to a client for advice or for legal proceedings` IS FALSE
    `furthers an illegal purpose` IS FALSE
    `proves no reason to suspect prejudice` IS FALSE
    `is done in enforcing the law` IS FALSE

